  "content": "<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <link href=\"https://www.cra-arc.gc.ca/wet-boew/css/custom/theme-topic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"></div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"provisional profile\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            \n            <div class=\"intro col-md-12 col-sm-12 mrgn-bttm-md\">\n                <h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\" class=\"provisional gc-thickline\">Taxes</h1>\n                <section data-ajax-replace=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/includes/generic_disruption.txt#disruption-en\"></section><p>Tax information for individuals, businesses, charities, and trusts.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"provisional most-requested-bullets well well-sm brdr-0\"><div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"pddng-r-0 col-md-2\">\n                <h2 class=\"mrgn-tp-md\">Most requested</h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-10\">\n                \n                <ul class=\"wb-eqht mrgn-tp-md mrgn-bttm-md colcount-md-2\"><li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/cra-login-services.html\">CRA sign in</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/gst-hst-businesses/file-gst-hst-return/how-file.html#h_3\">Ready to file your GST/HST return</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/en/services/benefits/calendar.html\">Find benefit payment dates</a></li>\n\n                    <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/forms-publications.html\">Forms and publications</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/payments/payments-cra.html\">Make a payment to the CRA</a></li>\n\n                </ul></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        \n        <section class=\"gc-srvinfo col-md-12\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Services and information</h2>\n            <div class=\"wb-eqht row\">\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/income-tax.html\">Income tax</a></h3>\n                    <p>Personal, business, corporation, trust, and non-resident income tax, taxes for someone who died</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/payments.html\">Payments</a></h3>\n                    <p>How to send money to the CRA, receive your payments, options if you are unable to pay a debt</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/child-and-family-benefits.html\">Tax credits and benefits for individuals</a></h3>\n                    <p>Payment dates, eligibility for children, caregivers, people with disabilities, workers and others</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/gst-hst-businesses.html\">GST/HST</a></h3>\n                    <p>GST/HST accounts, collect and remit the tax, file a return, claim rebates, search the GST/HST registry</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll.html\">Payroll</a></h3>\n                    <p>Payroll accounts, deductions and contributions, information returns, and benefits and allowances</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/business-registration.html\">Business registration</a></h3>\n                    <p>Get a business number (BN) or program accounts, find an existing BN, changes to a business</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/charities.html\">Charities and giving</a></h3>\n                    <p>How to register and run a charity, charities listings, and charitable tax credits</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/savings-and-pension-plans.html\">Savings and pension plans</a></h3>\n                    <p>Tax-free savings accounts, registered savings plans, pooled pension plans, and plan administration</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/excise-taxes-duties-and-levies.html\">Excise and specialty taxes</a></h3>\n                    <p>Duties, customs, charges, tax on underused housing, luxury items, digital services revenue</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/scams-fraud.html\">Scams and fraud</a></h3>\n                    <p>Protect yourself against scams, how to report scams, identity theft, or tax cheating</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/support-difficult-situations.html\">Support in difficult situations</a></h3>\n                    <p>Support in situations of abuse or disaster, CRA debts during financial hardship, past COVID-19 payments</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/programs/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/compliance.html\">Compliance and enforcement</a></h3>\n                    <p>Reporting obligations, debt collection, audits, tax relief, objections or appeals</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n                    <h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/make-a-service-complaint.html\">CRA Service feedback</a></h3>\n                    <p>Send feedback to the CRA about a service experience</p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </section></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"provisional gc-prtts mrgn-tp-0\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <section class=\"provisional col-md-12 mrgn-bttm-md mrgn-tp-0\"><h2>Features</h2>\n                <div class=\"wb-eqht row\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 mrgn-rght-0 mrgn-lft-0\">\n                        <div class=\"well eqht-trgt\"><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/campaigns/every-dollar-counts.html\" data-gc-analytics=\"promo:promotionalfeature\">\n                                <figure><div> <img src=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/camp-promo/features/bnnr-bnfts-credits-2026-360x203.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive thumbnail mrgn-bttm-sm\"></div>\n                                    <figcaption>Sometimes life can feel off balance</figcaption><div>\n                                        <p>Benefits, credits, and housing programs can help. Find out what you may qualify for.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </figure></a> </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 mrgn-lft-0\">\n                        <div class=\"well eqht-trgt\"><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/individuals/community-volunteer-income-tax-program.html\" data-gc-analytics=\"promo:promotionalfeature\">\n                                <figure><div> <img src=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/camp-promo/features/cvtp_bnnr_360x203.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive thumbnail mrgn-bttm-sm\"></div>\n                                    <figcaption>Volunteer at a free tax clinic!</figcaption><p>Help people do their taxes so they can get important benefits and credits.</p>\n                                </figure></a> </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n\n                    <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 mrgn-rght-0 mrgn-rght-0\">\n                        <div class=\"well eqht-trgt\"><a href=\"https://www.census.gc.ca/en/index?utm_source=cra-web-tile&amp;utm_medium=pog&amp;utm_campaign=statcan-statcan-2026-genpop-collection-26-27&amp;utm_content=gr-119-en-census-wrapper\" data-gc-analytics=\"promo:promotionalfeature\">\n                                <figure><div> <img src=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/camp-promo/features/ft_360x203px_2026-04-21.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive thumbnail mrgn-bttm-sm\"></div>\n                                    <figcaption>The 2026 Census is underway</figcaption><p>Find information on how to complete your census today.  </p>\n                                </figure></a> </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section></div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <section class=\"gc-contributors col-md-8 mrgn-tp-md\"><h2>From:</h2>\n            <ul><li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency.html\">Canada Revenue Agency</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"https://www.cbsa-asfc.gc.ca/menu-eng.html\">Canada Border Services Agency</a></li>\n            </ul></section></div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>"
